  "summary": "No Concord component creates, names, splits, focuses, or destroys a tab, pane, window, or session: the host owns placement and starts and resumes operator sessions, and a host-started session enters managed work through concord_work_start. The boundary binds every Concord binary with no session entry route; the entry route's resume and pass-through duties retired with it.",
